—¡Marielle!
—Vamos.

273
00:16:17,775 --> 00:16:19,010
—¡Rápido!
—Vamos.

274
00:16:19,477 --> 00:16:20,613
¡Apúrate!

275
00:16:20,745 --> 00:16:22,748
—¡Marielle!
—Lo tengo.

276
00:16:24,082 --> 00:16:25,551
¡Vamos! ¡Entremos aquí!

277
00:16:31,190 --> 00:16:33,325
