287
00:17:27,945 --> 00:17:29,847
—Dime qué hacer.
—¿Dónde está Kristi?

288
00:17:30,249 --> 00:17:32,250
—Quiero ver a Kristi.
—Lo sé.

289
00:17:43,862 --> 00:17:44,863
No, espera.

290
00:17:45,530 --> 00:17:46,531
No puede ser.

291
00:17:47,766 --> 00:17:49,167
No puede ser, diablos.

292
00:17:49,300 --> 00:17:50,568
—Acelera.
—Diablos.

293
00:17:50,669 --> 00:17:52,604
Diablos. Bien, vamos.

294
00:17:52,770 --> 00:17:53,771
¡Acelera!

295
00:17:57,976 --> 00:17:59,377
¡Todos adentro!

296
00:17:59,478 --> 00:18:01,046
—¡No!
—¡Adentro!

297
00:18:01,145 --> 00:18:02,748
No.

298
00:18:03,048 --> 00:18:04,383
—Rápido.
—¡Mari!

299
00:18:04,615 --> 00:18:05,817
¡Aquí!

300
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:13,125
